/span> DHM<sup>l.c.</sup>); opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשָּׁה</span> in command ag. sodomy <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.22\">Lv 18:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.13\">20:13</a> (both H)."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of animals, especially for sacrifice <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:19\" href=\"/Exodus.34.19\">Ex 34:19</a> (JE; read <span dir=\"rtl\">הַזָּכָר</span> for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּזָּכָר</span>); <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:5\" href=\"/Exodus.12.5\">Ex 12:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.3\">Lv 1:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.23\">4:23</a> (all P) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.19\">22:19</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Malachi 1:14\" href=\"/Malachi.1.14\">Mal 1:14</a>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְקֵבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:19\" href=\"/Genesis.6.19\">Gn 6:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:3\" href=\"/Genesis.7.3\">7:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:9\" href=\"/Genesis.7.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:16\" href=\"/Genesis.7.16\">16</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:1\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.1\">Lv 3:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.6\">6</a> (all P)"}],"num":"2."}],"num":"I."},{"senses":[{"definition":"adj. sg. <em>male</em> (only human beings) <span dir=\"rtl\">יֻלַּד־לְךָ בֵּן ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.15\">Je 20:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־בְּכֹר ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:40\" href=\"/Numbers.3.40\">Nu 3:40</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:43\" href=\"/Numbers.3.43\">43</a> (both P)."}],"num":"II."}]},"rid":"BDB02640","strong_numbers":["2145"],"next_hw":"זָכוּר","prev_hw":"זֵ֫כֶר","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["2351"],"TWOT":["551e"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"